stently hidden behind SNMP_COMMUNITY or redacted, preventing independent confirmation of its exact literal name.","limitations":["The captured evidence proves that one configured community works read-only from node2, but it does not expose the value needed to verify that it is literally branch-readonly.","Lifecycle snapshots do not inventory installed packages or firewall configuration; those aspects rely on direct executor command output, which is coherent and includes post-restart checks."]}
